>传入version = </strong><code><strong>V2_3_2</strong></code><strong> 查询最新的行政区划信息</strong>，并在创建/编辑项目、定向包时传入最新的值</li></ol><ul data-id=\"udcdd064-1eZO7ZiR\" data-indent=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-HkdNFLXP\">变更节奏:2024年3月19日起逐步覆盖全部投放账户</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-1PzuDsBL\">相关链接：<a href=\"https://bytedance.larkoffice.com/sheets/MEqSsasm4h23kItFrfLcCzcxnmf?sheet=NDMvkl\" target=\"_blank\">巨量营销升级版行政区域划分更新明细一对外版本</a></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-9nC1SBG8\"><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">注意：项目创编接口的region_version= 2.3.2，对应本接口的version = V2_3_2  枚举</span></li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-NNQzuKWe\"><br/></p><ol data-id=\"oa950d4e-kmbIR83N\" start=\"2\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-gN2oO5Qg\">本接口需要与【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1709606374050823\" target=\"_blank\">查询国家/区域信息</a>】接口搭配使用，通过该接口先拿到查询国家/区域的行政编码code，传入到本接口的请求参数codes中，查询国家/区域下具体的省份等行政区域信息</li></ol></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201790225265304585%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-HelIN0ED\" id=\"h346b9f0-HelIN0ED\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-ahN94KnP\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/tools/admin/info/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/tools/admin/info/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1709606596424718\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-jjAi3niE\" id=\"h346b9f0-jjAi3niE\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-8W41vLF6\">GET</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-I9SXMKIL\" id=\"h346b9f0-I9SXMKIL\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-sO1gIIJ2\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-Lhhp1QJU\" id=\"h346b9f0-Lhhp1QJU\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 184px;\" width=\"184\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">advertiser_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-YbGJvynD\">客户id</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">codes</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-5C0jHj3u\">行政区域编码列表，code可先从【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1709606374050823\" target=\"_blank\">查询国家/区域信息</a>】接口获取</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">language</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-aXttInCj\">语言类型<br/>`ZH_CN`表示常用名，如“北京”<br/>`ZH_CN_GOV`表示官方全称，如“北京市” 可选值: </p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-RBJMmALP\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-62OSmFUM\"><code>ZH_CN</code> 常用名。如：北京</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-0NLUl8MV\"><code>ZH_CN_GOV</code> 官方名称。如：北京市</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">sub_district</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-8ReDesvT\">行政区域层级。<br/>`NONE` 当前层级<br/>`ONE_LEVEL`下一级区域<br/>`TWO_LEVEL`下二级区域<br/>`THREE_LEVEL`下三级区域<br/>`FOUR_LEVEL`下四级区域 可选值: </p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-315F5YXO\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-oL1DPcj8\"><code>FOUR_LEVEL</code> 四级行政区域-乡镇</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-o6JCDOjG\"><code>NONE</code> 零级行政区域-国家</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Ed3iFF15\"><code>ONE_LEVEL</code> 一级行政区域-省</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-HSUdGk0O\"><code>THREE_LEVEL</code> 三级行政区域-区县</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-pR60OBEq\"><code>TWO_LEVEL</code> 二级行政区域-市</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">version</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-fDg8VrO5\">行政区划版本 可选值: </p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-NQYEHgP2\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Kd5LYf54\"><code>V1_0_0</code> 旧版本（默认值）</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-tdQEXFbL\"><code>V2_3_2</code> 新版本，行政区划版本升级说明详见<a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/help_center/content/140368?graphId=560&amp;mappingType=2&amp;pageId=321&amp;spaceId=195&amp;timestamp=1709265969109\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #323335;\">「定向-按行政区域划分」变更说明</span></a></li></ul></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-J1MSfn0Y\" id=\"h346b9f0-J1MSfn0Y\">请求示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-mulit-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"multicodeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22langs%22%3A%5B%7B%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%23%20coding%3Dutf-8%5Cnimport%20json%5Cnimport%20requests%5Cn%5Cnfrom%20six%20import%20string_types%5Cnfrom%20six.moves.urllib.parse%20import%20urlencode%2C%20urlunparse%20%20%23%20noqa%5Cn%5CnACCESS_TOKEN%20%3D%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%5CnPATH%20%3D%20%5C%22%2Fopen_api%2F2%2Ftools%2Fadmin%2Finfo%2F%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%5Cndef%20build_url(path%2C%20query%3D%5C%22%5C%22)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str%2C%20str)%20-%3E%20str%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Build%20request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20path%3A%20Request%20path%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20query%3A%20Querystring%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20scheme%2C%20netloc%20%3D%20%5C%22https%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22api.oceanengine.com%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20urlunparse((scheme%2C%20netloc%2C%20path%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22%2C%20query%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22))%5Cn%5Cndef%20get(json_str)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str)%20-%3E%20dict%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Send%20GET%20request%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20json_str%3A%20Args%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Response%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20args%20%3D%20json.loads(json_str)%5Cn%20%20%20%20query_string%20%3D%20urlencode(%7Bk%3A%20v%20if%20isinstance(v%2C%20string_types)%20else%20json.dumps(v)%20for%20k%2C%20v%20in%20args.items()%7D)%5Cn%20%20%20%20url%20%3D%20build_url(PATH%2C%20query_string)%5Cn%20%20%20%20headers%20%3D%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22Access-Token%5C%22%3A%20ACCESS_TOKEN%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20rsp%20%3D%20requests.get(url%2C%20headers%3Dheaders)%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20rsp.json()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%5Cnif%20__name__%20%3D%3D%20'__main__'%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20advertiser_id%20%3D%20ADVERTISER_ID%5Cn%20%20%20%20codes_list%20%3D%20CODES%5Cn%20%20%20%20codes%20%3D%20json.dumps(codes_list)%5Cn%20%20%20%20language%20%3D%20LANGUAGE%5Cn%20%20%20%20sub_district%20%3D%20SUB_DISTRICT%5Cn%20%20%20%20version%20%3D%20VERSION%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20Args%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20my_args%20%3D%20%5C%22%7B%5C%5C%5C%22advertiser_id%5C%5C%5C%22%3A%20%5C%5C%5C%22%25s%5C%5C%5C%22%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%22codes%5C%5C%5C%22%3A%20%25s%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%22language%5C%5C%5C%22%3A%20%5C%5C%5C%22%25s%5C%5C%5C%22%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%22sub_district%5C%5C%5C%22%3A%20%5C%5C%5C%22%25s%5C%5C%5C%22%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%22version%5C%5C%5C%22%3A%20%5C%5C%5C%22%25s%5C%5C%5C%22%7D%5C%22%20%25%20(adverti